OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm plan to be reconsidered
OL,4,Aafter challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a 126-acre (50 hectare)
OL,7,Fsolar farm in North Yorkshire are to be
OL,8,Freconsidered after a High Court judge
OL,9,Fquashed a previous decision to grant
OL,10,Fpermission.
OL,12,FThe Woolpots scheme, near the village
OL,13,Fof Husthwaite, was approved on appeal
OL,14,Fin October 2025, after being refused by
OL,15,FNorth Yorkshire Council.
OL,17,FThis was then overturned in August
OL,18,Ffollowing a legal challenge from
OL,19,Fresident Philip Hewitson, who argued
OL,20,Fthat the plan did not properly consider
OL,21,Fthe impact on the landscape.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
