OL,3,GNEWSASolar farm plan to be reconsidered
OL,4,Aafter challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Planning Inspectorate has now said
OL,7,Fthe appeal will be reconsidered, with a
OL,8,Fhearing set for 25 November.
